      "content": "<h3>Creating a Vector: four constructors</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>new Vector&lt;&gt;()</code>: empty, capacity 10, doubles when full.</li>\n<li><code>new Vector&lt;&gt;(int initialCapacity)</code>: empty with the given capacity, doubles when full.</li>\n<li><code>new Vector&lt;&gt;(int initialCapacity, int capacityIncrement)</code>: grows by <strong>that fixed amount</strong> instead of doubling.</li>\n<li><code>new Vector&lt;&gt;(Collection c)</code>: a copy of another collection.</li>\n</ul>",
