      "content": "<h3>Vector versus ArrayList</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;\">\n<tr><th style=\"text-align:left;\"></th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">Vector</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">ArrayList</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Thread safety</td><td>Yes: every method is synchronized</td><td>No</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Speed (single thread)</td><td>Slower (lock on each call)</td><td>Faster</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Growth when full</td><td>Doubles (or fixed increment)</td><td>Grows by 50%</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Since</td><td>Java 1.0 (retrofitted to List in 1.2)</td><td>Java 1.2</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Old methods</td><td>addElement, elementAt, elements() ...</td><td>None</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Iterators</td><td>Iterator (fail-fast) and Enumeration (not fail-fast)</td><td>Iterator (fail-fast)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Read capacity</td><td><code>capacity()</code></td><td>Not possible</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Today</td><td>Legacy</td><td><strong>Default list</strong></td></tr>\n</table>"
